# Charged ollie, FS 360 Shove-It (Right, then Right with J, then J again: the double tap on THPS 2's
# double-direction slot; it was J + up left J before 2026-11-16, now the 360 Hardflip) right after the pop:
# the flip finishes and the combo lands (the view's flip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap right 92
tap flip+right 96
tap flip 99
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=FS 360 Shove-It} within 100..100
expect event trickEnd{trick=FS 360 Shove-It} within 120..175
expect event comboLanded{name=FS 360 Shove-It,points=300} within 160..240
expect no event bail
